Source: ps3-games-licensed
Section: local/games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Tiberiu Chibici <chibicitiberiu@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ps3-games-licensed
Architecture: all
Section: local/games
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ps3-games, classicube-data, quake-shareware, quake2-demo-data,
 sauerbraten-nonfree-data
Description: the PS3 game suite's licensed game data (personal and LAN use only)
 ps3-games plus the data its games need that we may not redistribute: ClassiCube's textures,
 sounds and music (classicube-data, Mojang's), Quake's shareware data (quake-shareware) and
 Quake II's demo (quake2-demo-data) and the Sauerbraten models and sounds Debian's cube2-data
 leaves out (sauerbraten-nonfree-data, CC BY-NC). For personal and LAN use only: this package and its
 dependencies live in the ps3-licensed suite of our own repository, never in a public one. The
 free packages do not depend on any of this; anyone else puts the data in the game directories
 by hand (/usr/share/doc/classicube/README.Debian).
